  "worked_solution": "The general equation of forced harmonic motion with damping is\n\n$$\nm{y}^{\u2033}=-c{y}^{\u2032}-ky+F(t).\n$$\n\nSubstituting our values for $m,$ $k,$ $c$ and $F(t)$ gives\n\n$$\n8{y}^{\u2033}=-16{y}^{\u2032}-10y+4{t}^{2}.\n$$\n\nSimplifying and rearranging the above equation, we get\n\n$$\n{y}^{\u2033}+2{y}^{\u2032}+\\frac{5}{4}y=\\frac{1}{2}{t}^{2}.\n$$",
